    "text": "KRGV\nwebsite\nMcallen\nTrial date set for man charged in deadly wrong-way causeway crash\nBy Jose De Leon III,\n7 hours agoA trial date was announced for the McAllen man accused of drunkenly driving the wrong way on the Queen Isabella Memorial Causeway last year and killing a 20-year-old woman. Hugo Ernesto Lara’s trial will go before a jury on Monday, Oct. 13, 2025, court records show. Lara was arrested...\n1",
